{"4396320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SUPER SKILL ISSUE", "steam_appid": 4396320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPER SKILL ISSUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/extras/e9345d52fa710ce58842f16527c6f0c9.poster.avif?t=1773399554\" width=838 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/extras/e9345d52fa710ce58842f16527c6f0c9.webm?t=1773399554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/extras/e9345d52fa710ce58842f16527c6f0c9.mp4?t=1773399554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rage platformer about having way too much power<br>and absolutely no self-control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the main hazard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies but one (guess who?)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport straight into a sharp object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricochet your own laser into your skull</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overshoot a perfect jump by <i>this much</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a poorly timed double jump flip can kill you (watch the knees)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level didn’t do this.<br><strong>You did.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPER SKILL ISSUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/extras/e9345d52fa710ce58842f16527c6f0c9.poster.avif?t=1773399554\" width=838 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/extras/e9345d52fa710ce58842f16527c6f0c9.webm?t=1773399554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/extras/e9345d52fa710ce58842f16527c6f0c9.mp4?t=1773399554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rage platformer about having way too much power<br>and absolutely no self-control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the main hazard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies but one (guess who?)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport straight into a sharp object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricochet your own laser into your skull</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overshoot a perfect jump by <i>this much</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a poorly timed double jump flip can kill you (watch the knees)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level didn’t do this.<br><strong>You did.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A brutal precision platformer where your own superpowers are the biggest threat.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/c1b734c1aad539929d3d9b436239b2aaf47ffdf3/header.jpg?t=1773399554", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/f8da7b338f1784dc0615e1f9b8379957dac3b7ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773399554", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396320/f8da7b338f1784dc0615e1f9b8379957dac3b7ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773399554", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 2200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</str